              "text": "Dr Baseer Achakzai, Director Nutrition, Ministry of National Health Services, Regulations and Coordination, along with Dr Eric Alain Ategbo, Nutrition Lead, UNICEF Pakistan, met Dr Zulfiqar Bhutta, Dr Sajid Soofi, Dr Atif Habib, and the NNS team for a progress review meeting on the National Nutrition Survey 2018/2019, at AKU, Karachi. "
